WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.560
- It's nice to have new
coaches on "The Voice,"

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:02.850
and y'all are so good, you and Chance.

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:05.400
I do love In that clip, that
Chance thought it was so funny

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.840
that you were turning Blake's chair around

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.040
as you turned his around.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.252
- Yeah, Just like, "What's going on?"

00:00:10.252 --> 00:00:11.085
(laughs)

00:00:11.085 --> 00:00:11.918
- [Kelly Clarkson] That was awesome!

00:00:11.918 --> 00:00:12.751
- Then I just head-butted yours.

00:00:12.751 --> 00:00:14.370
- I love too, though,
that you jumped right in

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:16.710
to giving Shelton crap. I love it!

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:19.170
- No, for sure, I love winding him up.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.460
- Cause you're a country boy.

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:21.450
Like, we're country people too.

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:22.590
And so it was, like, really nice

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:23.910
that you came in and, like,

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:25.380
just felt right at home with that.

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:26.400
- Wind the old man up!

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:27.840
- Made me feel really good.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:28.673
(laughs)

00:00:28.673 --> 00:00:29.506
- I was like, I have a team.

00:00:29.506 --> 00:00:30.339
- You're a pro at it.

00:00:30.339 --> 00:00:32.392
- I am. I am. Well,
practice makes perfect.

00:00:32.392 --> 00:00:33.225
(laughs)

00:00:33.225 --> 00:00:34.500
- So, you've definitely perfected, though,

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:35.550
the Blake impression.

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:37.800
We've done interviews for the show and he,

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.600
I want you to just, how
do you talk like Blake?

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:40.560
- Well, the other day they told me

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:41.970
I sounded like Forrest Gump.

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:42.947
- No, you don't!

00:00:42.947 --> 00:00:43.780
(laughs)

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:45.060
- He was saying that. He's Dumb.

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:46.663
- This is my last season on "The Voice."

00:00:46.663 --> 00:00:48.630
(laughs)

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:51.796
- I want you to be on my team,
and I hate Kelly Clarkson.

00:00:51.796 --> 00:00:52.629
(laughs)

00:00:52.629 --> 00:00:53.700
- Yep.

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:54.533
- [Niall Horan] That's what
it usually sounds like.

00:00:54.533 --> 00:00:55.366
- About sums it up.

00:00:55.366 --> 00:00:56.199
(laughs)

